From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:09:34 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 063/207] In-model runner: the inline form owns the value after
 a whole arithmetic expression's =

TF_DSV41_RUNNER_FORMS=...,inline (off by default): a line ending at = or '= '
after a complete expression (no other =, comparison, glued word, comma list,
gap or dangling operator) is a cell and its own trigger; only the value is
owned, and a budget, fault or multi-line result leaves the model's text.
